     CALL "EM3-ROWS" USING EMM-MODEL WS-ROWS1-R WS-N1 WS-ZERO
     MOVE 128 TO MM-TEXW
     MOVE 128 TO MM-TEXH
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM EF8-M-NAUTILUS.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. EF8-M-NAUTILUS-BABY.
*> USING model: the baby nautilus (34-8 6.2, texture 64 x 64).
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-ROWS1.
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P nroot root -0.5 28 -0.5 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P shell nroot 3 -8 -2 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C shell 0 0 -6 -4 -1 7 4 7 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C shell 0 11 -6 0 -1 7 4 9 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C shell 23 11 -6 0 5 7 4 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P body nroot 0.5 -5 3 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C body 0 24 -2.5 -3.01 -1 5 4 7 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C body 0 35 -2.5 -3.01 4.1 5 4 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P upper_mouth body 0 -2.01 3.9 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C upper_mouth 24 24 -2.5 -1 0 5 2 2 -0.001 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P inner_mouth body 0 -1.01 4.9 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C inner_mouth 24 32 -1.5 -1 -1 3 2 2 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P lower_mouth body 0 -0.01 3.9 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C lower_mouth 24 28 -2.5 -1 0 5 2 2 -0.001 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE SPACES OCCURS 66 TIMES.
 01 WS-ROWS1-R REDEFINES WS-ROWS1.
    05 WS-ROW1             PIC X(100) OCCURS 80 TIMES.
 01 WS-N1                  BINARY-LONG VALUE 14.
 01 WS-ZERO                FLOAT-LONG VALUE 0.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY CLEMM.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING EMM-MODEL.
     CALL "EMM-INIT" USING EMM-MODEL
     CALL "EM3-ROWS" USING EMM-MODEL WS-ROWS1-R WS-N1 WS-ZERO
     MOVE 64 TO MM-TEXW
     MOVE 64 TO MM-TEXH
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM EF8-M-NAUTILUS-BABY.
